@startuml cu17
!theme plain
title CU17 — Buscar gestiones de un cliente

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) looks up a client's managements.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (First name; Last name; Identification type and number)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) enters the search data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Looks up and presents a list of the client's managements.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects a management.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows the data of the selected management.
System -> System : System

@enduml